n>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> on the complex plane, </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>the roots form a regular octagon (regular <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"72\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-sided polygon).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is the following:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-162310-a-1\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-162310-a-1\"></div><div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-162310-a-2\"></div></div>",
